---
description: Require complete model names on every user-facing surface
alwaysApply: true
---

# Full Model Names

- Always display the complete configured/catalog model or generator name in every user-facing surface.
- Never abbreviate, ellipsize, clamp, truncate, or hide any part of a model name.
- Constrained layouts must wrap or reflow surrounding metadata and controls so the full name remains visible. A tooltip does not substitute for visible text.
- Internal keys may remain in diagnostics, but they must not replace the full display name in UI, documentation, release notes, or other user-facing prose.
